{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Man vs. Machine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "How Much Is Too Much"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You use wish to talk about things you do not have/do or cannot have/do.</p>You use the second conditional to talk about situations that are possible, but not likely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the second conditional, you are thinking about the future. We are thinking about a particular condition in the future, and the result of this condition. However, there is not a real possibility that this condition will happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> in place of <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, in the second conditional."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Condition<br/>(Past Simple tense)</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result<br/>(modal + base form)</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you wanted to be different,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you could change that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you hoped for a different future,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you should make it happen\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you wished,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you should come and see us\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you chose this third option,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"your brain power would increase\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use a comma after the <span class=\"italic\">if</span> clause when it at the beginning of the sentence. This shows that the sentence is not in the natural order."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you wanted to be different when you were young, but weren't, you could change that."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you hoped for a very different future, but didn't get it, you should make it happen."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you wished you had special powers, but didn't, you should come and see us."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you thought there must be a way to lift yourself out of the masses, then you would be right."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you chose this third option, your brain power would increase as well."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Subject and Object Relative Clauses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>When you want to make which person or thing you are talking about clearer, you use a relative clause.</p><p>You can begin a relative clause with <span class=\"italic\">who</span> for people, <span class=\"italic\">which</span> for things or <span class=\"italic\">that</span> for either people or things.<p>In spoken English you usually use <span class=\"italic\">that</span>, rather than <span class=\"italic\">which</span> or <span class=\"italic\">who</span>.</p>You put the relative clause immediately after the noun it talks about."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A subject relative clause describes the subject of the clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">The man who called wanted to speak to Tom.</span> <br/>Which man? The man who called."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The clause <span class=\"italic\">who</span> called immediately follows man - the noun it describes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "An object relative clause describes the object of the clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">The book that I lent you was my father's.</span><br/>Which book? The book I lent you."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Relative Connector</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Type of Relative Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The scientists who work at Micro Mind and Body can transform you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who work at Micro Mind and Body\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Become the extra-human that you have always dreamed of being.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that you have always dreamed of being\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The chip that we produce enables you sense others.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that we produce\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Be the enhanced cyborg that you have always wanted to be!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that you have always wanted to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bioartificial"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "artificially created in a lab"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bioartificial organs grown from your own cells are a perfect match."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "microchip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small electronic device"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Soon we may be able to get a microchip implanted in our brain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "device"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a machine invented for a specific purpose"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When you think of a robot, is it a device that resembles a human?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cyborg"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a being that is part human and part machine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are cyborgs in the Star Trek series!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to integrate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to mix and join"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How do you see robots integrating into our lives?"}, {"type": "audio", "co